3. Nordic Semiconductor: codal-microbit-nrf5sdk and the prebuilt binary objects
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The nRF5 SDK sources, and the SoftDevice, MBR, bootloader, settings and UICR objects this package
links (codal/libraries/codal-microbit-v2/lib/*.o), are Nordic Semiconductor's. Their licence permits
use only with Nordic Semiconductor integrated circuits, which the BBC micro:bit V2 uses.

